# Implementation Plan for SQAuto Initial Scaffolding

## Goal Description
Create the foundational repository structure, Docker dev environment, FastAPI backend, Next.js frontend, worker scaffolding, shared config, placeholder routes and services, and a new UI specification document (`UI_FRONTEND_SPECS.md`). All work must strictly follow the existing markdown documentation (AGENT.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, DOCS.md, FILE_STRUCTURE.md, PROMPT_SPECS.md, SAFETY_RULES.md, TECH_STACK.md) and respect safety boundaries (read‑only source, staging‑only transformations, AI assistive only, no production writes).

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> Please review the proposed file layout, Docker setup, and placeholder code. Confirm that the structure aligns with the `FILE_STRUCTURE.md` tree and that no safety rules are violated. Approve to proceed with file creation.

